; TU3 evaluation gate (the metrics) for GET / — the filmstrip.  The tile set
; is read from its one home, ../server/lib/pages/filmstrip.ml, never from the
; page's own HTML.  The gate is node + chromium over CDP; chromium drives the
; 390x844 and 1280x800 metrics.  Node absent is the ONLY skip in this stanza —
; the node invocation is bare, so a regression exits nonzero with no manual
; step and no `|| true` on the way.
(rule
 (alias runtest)
 (deps ../tools/filmstrip_cdp.mjs ../server/lib/pages/filmstrip.ml)
 (action
  (bash
   "if command -v node >/dev/null 2>&1; then node %{workspace_root}/tools/filmstrip_cdp.mjs; else echo 'filmstrip_cdp: skip (node absent)'; fi")))

